  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34676072",
      "title": "Why You Might Need Custom Page Response Headers",
      "lectureOrder": 105,
      "videoOrder": 98,
      "sourceHash": "fdbe85c59e362046155f8333f8b4ded97774fa5ab1f7c8576b5c5c5f614ef4b8",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 5.04,
          "en": "Now adding metadata is a quite common task.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.04,
          "end": 6.69,
          "en": "Another quite common task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.69,
          "end": 8.19,
          "en": "which you definitely wanna look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.19,
          "end": 9.949,
          "en": "into right before you deploy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.949,
          "end": 14.949,
          "en": "is setting some headers on your page responses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.78,
          "end": 17.23,
          "en": "But what do I mean with that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.09,
          "end": 19.343,
          "en": "Well, in our application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.343,
          "end": 20.58,
          "en": "we are, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.58,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "sending many responses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 25.32,
          "en": "For example, when our loader returns data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.32,
          "end": 28.35,
          "en": "you learned that Remix wraps this into a response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.35,
          "end": 30.57,
          "en": "And you could alternatively also do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.57,
          "end": 32.13,
          "en": "on your own, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 32.13,
          "end": 34.74,
          "en": "with this Jason helper method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.74,
          "end": 36.6,
          "en": "But the important thing to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 36.6,
          "end": 39.33,
          "en": "is that the loader sends back a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.33,
          "end": 40.89,
          "en": "and so do our actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 40.89,
          "end": 43.08,
          "en": "They sent back redirect responses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 43.08,
          "end": 46.17,
          "en": "or responses with error data, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 46.17,
          "end": 49.23,
          "en": "But we always send back responses to the front end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 49.23,
          "end": 52.03,
          "en": "We have this communication with help of responses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 53.22,
          "end": 56.73,
          "en": "but we also send the response if we just load a page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 56.73,
          "end": 58.77,
          "en": "If we load this list of components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 58.77,
          "end": 62.01,
          "en": "if this component here gets rendered to the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.01,
          "end": 63.69,
          "en": "as you learned in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 63.69,
          "end": 66.84,
          "en": "this page component actually first gets rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 66.84,
          "end": 70.08,
          "en": "on the server and then the finished HTML document",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.08,
          "end": 72.36,
          "en": "is sent to the client.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.36,
          "end": 74.73,
          "en": "At least if you just arrived on the website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 74.73,
          "end": 76.95,
          "en": "Thereafter, you are probably back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 76.95,
          "end": 78.69,
          "en": "in a single page application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 78.69,
          "end": 82.5,
          "en": "But if you just enter a URL of one specific page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 82.5,
          "end": 84.12,
          "en": "or if you reload a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 84.12,
          "end": 87.39,
          "en": "then the finished HTML document is served.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 87.39,
          "end": 89.28,
          "en": "And you can easily confirm this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 89.28,
          "end": 91.14,
          "en": "by taking a look at the network tab",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 91.14,
          "end": 93.78,
          "en": "and taking a look at this first request here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 93.78,
          "end": 95.94,
          "en": "which is the request for the overall website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 95.94,
          "end": 97.89,
          "en": "And then taking a look at the response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 97.89,
          "end": 100.77000000000001,
          "en": "Here you'll find the HTML document.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 100.77000000000001,
          "end": 102.87,
          "en": "Yes, with a bunch of JavaScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 102.87,
          "end": 105.81,
          "en": "but ultimately also with all the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 105.81,
          "end": 107.16,
          "en": "that makes up this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 107.16,
          "end": 110.16,
          "en": "It's just formatted in a very unreadable way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 110.16,
          "end": 111.93,
          "en": "but everything's there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 111.93,
          "end": 113.94,
          "en": "So we get the finished document",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 113.94,
          "end": 116.31,
          "en": "and I'm talking about the headers attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 116.31,
          "end": 119.25,
          "en": "to the response that serves this document.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 119.25,
          "end": 120.69,
          "en": "So I'm talking about headers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 120.69,
          "end": 124.293,
          "en": "attached to this first request here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 125.19,
          "end": 128.4,
          "en": "You might want to add your own response headers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 128.4,
          "end": 131.52,
          "en": "which are added in addition to these default headers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 131.52,
          "end": 132.69,
          "en": "And when it comes to that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 132.69,
          "end": 135.393,
          "en": "Remix again gives you a couple of options.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
